OL,3,AUS tech stocks see sharp falls as AI
OL,4,Aspending nears $1tn
OL,5,
OL,6,FTech stocks tumbled for the second day
OL,7,Fin a row as concerns rise over the
OL,8,Fhundreds of billions of dollars they
OL,9,Fare investing in artificial
OL,10,Fintelligence (AI).
OL,12,FShares in Intel plummeted by as much as
OL,13,F30% following Google owner Alphabet's
OL,14,Fstock price plunging by more than
OL,15,F$500bn in the previous day's trading.
OL,17,FOther tech stocks including Reddit and
OL,18,FAmazon also fell while the Nasdaq index
OL,19,Fof the largest tech firms listed in the
OL,20,FUS sank over 3.5%.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
