OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile tech firms as spending big on AI,
OL,7,Fsome of their earnings are not meeting
OL,8,Fanalysts' expectations, spooking
OL,9,Finvestors and creating fears about a
OL,10,Fpotential AI bubble.
